{
  "_id": "index-zoram-1",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "has keys of treasury, 1 Ne. 4:20. thinks Nephi1 is Laban, 1 Ne. 4:21–27. is frightened by sight of brothers of Nephi1, 1 Ne. 4:30. is seized, promises to accompany family of Lehi1, 1 Ne. 4:31–37. takes eldest daughter of Ishmael1 to wife, 1 Ne. 16:7. is blessed by Lehi1, 2 Ne. 1:30–32. is true friend to Nephi1, 2 Ne. 1:30. becomes follower of Nephi1, 2 Ne. 5:6. Ammoron is descendant of Zoram, Alma 54:23.",
